    "body": "The CMake -Werror=dev flag is deprecated in CMake 4.4+ and replaced with -Werror=author. This change updates all build scripts and CI configuration files to use the new flag to avoid deprecation warnings.\n\nThe -Werror=author flag treats author warnings (CMake developer warnings) as errors, which is the direct replacement for -Werror=dev per CMake 4.4 release notes.",
