      "message": "build: replace deprecated -Werror=dev with -Werror=author\n\nThe CMake -Werror=dev flag is deprecated in CMake 4.4+ and replaced with\n-Werror=author. This change updates all build scripts and CI configuration\nfiles to use the new flag to avoid deprecation warnings.\n\nThe -Werror=author flag treats author warnings (CMake developer warnings)\nas errors, which is the direct replacement for -Werror=dev per CMake 4.4\nrelease notes.",
